From: xboxnative contributors
Subject: [PATCH] winebuild: mark PE constant data read-only
SPDX-License-Identifier: LGPL-2.1-or-later

Wine 10's generic .rodata assembler spelling becomes a writable orphan section
with GNU MinGW tools. Use the PE constant-data section and explicit read-only
flags for PE targets. Do not strip or modify load-config contents or security
requirements. ELF and Mach-O output is unchanged.

--- a/tools/winebuild/utils.c
+++ b/tools/winebuild/utils.c
@@ -1029,6 +1029,8 @@ const char *get_asm_rodata_section(void)
 {
     switch (target.platform)
     {
+    case PLATFORM_MINGW:
+    case PLATFORM_WINDOWS: return ".section .rdata,\"dr\"";
     case PLATFORM_APPLE: return ".const";
     default:             return ".section .rodata";
     }
